  },
  "binding": "current",
  "outcome": "completed",
  "summary": "Supersedes the first replay-lifecycle design without changing its single-flight call-order core. History retirement returns the external owner's actual applied, blocked or rejected outcome and never settles into a retired activation. editor.api.history remains the sole awaited Promise API; useEditorHistory becomes a void mounted dispatcher. One exact-runtime Editable.onHistoryReplay callback receives fulfilled mounted outcomes, while the dispatcher reports rejections. Pending is per-editor runtime lifecycle state. TaskHub-22's unchanged blocked head remains; explicit recovery is a separate API decision. The claim model now retains a reproducible wrong-insertion rule.",
  "proof": {
    "state": "partial",
    "evidence": [
      {
        "path": "docs/plans/artifacts/2026-09-23-history-replay-lifecycle/lifecycle.probe.test.ts",
        "sha256": "9c7616a54ed0275815ef3dfddd57e8dc49d5c30071a4425426794cb28ce0f9d9",
        "claim": "Nine disposable probes that assert current behavior: split timing, the fence rejecting typing, selection and history-skip commits, cross-editor leak through a shared descriptor, lost tags on queued replay, rejection from a throwing owner, and two Comments races."
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/plans/artifacts/2026-09-23-history-replay-lifecycle/lifecycle-probe.log",
        "sha256": "7b4e67158e291c9f1876a6e00d31257cc84e61639faf6fe36d1ffb7b359982c0",
        "claim": "Bun output: 9 pass, 0 fail, 26 assertions on 2026-09-23."
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/plans/artifacts/2026-09-23-history-replay-lifecycle-revised/claim-model.probe.test.ts",
        "sha256": "9162ebec46a949b397fafb4ab9892f2f2eba466552658a605560c3ada8407d98",
        "claim": "Exhaustive branch-order model comparing the settlement table with call-order replay for every settled sequence up to length 8, with settlement supplied as a parameter and a retained wrong-insertion rule."
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/plans/artifacts/2026-09-23-history-replay-lifecycle-revised/claim-model-probe.log",
        "sha256": "d837efc8e6e976aa3776e4c33da30638c19854d68aa148951824bc4ad8ca9abb",
        "claim": "Bun output: 2 pass, 0 fail, 1,684,894 assertions; the checked-in wrong rule diverges from call-order replay."
      }
    ],
    "limits": "Planning and design proof only. No target product source, package tests, browser behavior, Yjs mapping journals, mounted callback delivery or Comments serialization have been implemented or proved. The model covers string-level branch order, not mapped document changes."
  },
